        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%">On page 200, line 8, column ( c), the Total Plant in Service figure of $4,905,262,976 includes $5,578,613 of operating lease right-of-use assets. If the right-of-use-assets were excluded, the Total Plant In Service would result in a figure of $4,899,684,363. On page 208, line 15, column (b), the Total Plant in Service figure of $4,899,684,363 includes $72,628 of Asset Retirement Costs in Transmission Plant as of June 30th, 2026.</span>
      </div>
